    about:{ tag:"About Kimiya Kamali", title:"Kimiya Kamali – 10+ Years of Experience in Hair Transplantation & Aesthetics", paras:["Kimiya Kamali is the founder of Kimiya Hair & Aesthetics and has more than a decade of professional experience in hair transplantation, aesthetic consulting, and client guidance across Germany and Iran.","Throughout her career, she has participated in thousands of hair transplant procedures and gained extensive expertise in hairline design, high-density transplantation, and modern hair restoration techniques. Working with clients from diverse backgrounds has shaped her belief that hair transplantation is more than a procedure—it is a highly personal journey that requires precision, experience, and an artistic eye.","Today, Kimiya Hair & Aesthetics reflects years of dedication, expertise, and commitment to helping clients achieve natural-looking results tailored to their individual characteristics and goals.","Based in Düsseldorf and Cologne, Kimiya Kamali personally guides clients through every step of the consultation process, helping them understand their options and make informed decisions with confidence."], cta:"Book Consultation" },
