    faq:[{q:"Who is Kimiya Kamali?",a:"Kimiya Kamali is a personal hair specialist with over 10 years of experience. Kimiya Hair is her personal brand, not a clinic. She consults and guides every client personally, in German, English or Persian."},{q:"Where does Kimiya Kamali work?",a:"Kimiya Kamali works personally in both Düsseldorf and Cologne (Köln). Appointments are available in both cities. Reach out on WhatsApp and we will find the best location and time for you."},{q:"What does a consultation with Kimiya Hair cost?",a:"Costs are discussed individually and transparently in the personal consultation. Contact Kimiya directly for a first non-binding assessment."},{q:"Which method suits me: FUE or DHI?",a:"This depends on your hair structure, affected area and personal goals. Kimiya Kamali will walk you through all options clearly in a direct one-on-one conversation."},{q:"Can I get a consultation in German, English or Persian?",a:"Yes. Kimiya Kamali speaks German, English and Persian fluently and personally consults in your preferred language."},{q:"How quickly will I get an appointment?",a:"Kimiya typically replies within 24 hours on WhatsApp and confirms your appointment as soon as possible."}],
